 "section_summary": "This section continues a statistical roster of educational institutions in Fukushima Prefecture, completing the lists of village- and town-controlled youth and elementary schools and recording kindergartens and several categories of private schools. Entries give each institution’s location and founding date, together with enrollment and full- or part-time teacher totals for 30 April and 30 November 1946. The private-school portion covers commercial and middle schools, male, female, and coeducational youth schools, elementary schools, kindergartens, and an electrical industrial school.",
